title: The M-Apparat
new-page: true
view-if: crisis = 0 and congress = 0 and c_m_apparat_timer <= 0 and year >= 1921
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_m_apparat_timer = 5;
Q.month_actions += 1;
Q.c_m_found = 0;
!}
frequency: 150
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs

= The M-Apparat

The party has a secret military department, known to the few who know of it as the M-Apparat. It trains instructors for the red guards, watches the Reichswehr and keeps lists of weapons. [? if comintern_member = 1 : Officers of the Red Army's staff advise it, and Moscow pays for most of it. ?]

[? if c_m_apparat_built = 0 : For now it is small enough to hide. ?][? if c_m_apparat_built = 1 : It has grown, and more people know of it than should. ?][? if c_m_apparat_built >= 2 : It is large now, and the Zentrale suspects the political police already have a man inside. ?]

- @build: Expand it.
- @inward: Turn it against the police spies in our own ranks.
- @wind_up: Wind it up.
- @easy_discard

@build
subtitle: Costs 1 fund. More arms and trained men. The bigger it grows, the likelier the police find it.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We have no funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.c_m_apparat_built += 1;
if (Math.random() < 0.15 * Q.c_m_apparat_built) {
    Q.c_m_found = 1;
    Q.red_guards_arms = Math.max(0, Q.red_guards_arms - 10);
    Q.repression += 10;
    Q.c_m_apparat_built = 0;
    RG.news('Police uncover communist arms network', 3);
    RG.ledger('The police uncovered the M-Apparat.', 'm_apparat_found');
} else {
    Q.red_guards_arms += 8;
    Q.red_guards_strength += 1;
    Q.lean_offensive += 1;
}
!}

[? if c_m_found = 0 : Instructors are trained at a forest lodge in Thuringia, and rifles are bought from quartermasters who need the money. ?][? if c_m_found = 1 : The police raid the forest lodge, three depots and a flat in Charlottenburg with the lists. The apparatus is gone, and the papers have its name. ?]

@inward
subtitle: The party is harder to strike for a while.
on-arrival: {!
Q.repression -= 6;
Q.unity += 2;
!}

Two police informers are found in Berlin and one in Halle. They are not seen at meetings again.

@wind_up
subtitle: No secrets left to betray. The Left calls it cowardice.
view-if: c_m_apparat_built >= 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.c_m_apparat_built = 0;
Q.independence += 3;
Q.offensive_satisfaction -= 6;
Q.lean_luxemburgist += 1;
!}

The apparatus is reduced to a few couriers and a filing cabinet, and the filing cabinet is burned.
